(\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(A\), \(\[Mu]\)]\) \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(B\), \
\(\[Mu]\)]\) == \!\(\*SubscriptBox[\(A\), \(\[Nu]\)]\) \
\!\(\*SuperscriptBox[\(B\), \(\[Nu]\)]\)) ---\>\"", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
